===persian===

کبوتر در باران...
کبوتر در آب...
کبوتر در باد...
کبوتر در خواب...
کبوتر در مهتاب...
هر کبوتر دو سایه دارد،
سایه‌ای در آفتاب...
سایه‌ای در مهتاب...
سایه آفتابیش شاعر است...
سایه مهتابیش عاشق...
سایهٔ آفتابی از پرواز کبوتر می‌گریزد...
سایهٔ مهتابی برای آوازِ کبوتر دانه می‌ریزد...
آه ای دل...
کبوترِ بی‌تاب...
بی‌تاب در آتش... بی‌تاب در آب...
بی‌تاب در خواب... بی‌تاب در مهتاب...
۱۳۷۰/۹/۵

===machine===

A dove in the rain...
a dove in the water...
a dove in the wind...
a dove in sleep...
a dove in the moonlight...
Every dove has two shadows,
one shadow in the sunlight...
one shadow in the moonlight...
Its sun-shadow is a poet...
its moon-shadow a lover...
The sun-shadow flees the dove's flight...
the moon-shadow scatters grain for the dove's song...
Ah, my heart...
restless dove...
restless in the fire... restless in the water...
restless in sleep... restless in the moonlight...
1370/9/5

===lantern===

A dove in the rain,
a dove in the water,
a dove in the wind,
a dove in sleep,
a dove in the moonlight.
Every dove has two shadows:
one in the sunlight,
one in the moonlight.
Its sun-shadow is a poet.
Its moon-shadow is a lover.
The sun-shadow runs from the dove's flight;
the moon-shadow scatters grain for the dove's song.
Ah, my heart —
restless dove,
restless in the fire, restless in the water,
restless in sleep, restless in the moonlight...

1370/9/5

